bb-plugin-ast-grep
==================

This plugin calls the ast-grep CLI (https://github.com/ast-grep/ast-grep, MIT)
as an external binary. No ast-grep source is copied or linked into this
plugin: the relationship is the same as bb-plugin-rtk's with rtk.

The pattern language, the language grammars and the rewriting are ast-grep's;
this plugin contributes typed tools, token-shaped output and a preview-first
rewrite policy.

Everything in this repository is MIT, original work by prismatic7.
